    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "Hey everyone, it's Jory Rose. Welcome back to this episode, which I'm really excited to share with you. As you've heard me talk about, we just launched a free online summit titled Surviving to Thriving, how we can grow through adversity during this pandemic. While one of the interviews was so inspirational, I knew I needed to bring it on to the podcast so more people could hear it and be inspired by it. So this is my interview with Congressman Tim Ryan, who has a passion for mindfulness and mindful leadership and is doing a lot to create awareness and change in both Congress and is teaching us how we can do the same in our communities. You can still register for the summit at any time. If you visit surviving to thriving.site, the link is in the show notes. And these interviews are live for 30 days and free for 30 days from the time of release, but will forever be available on our site. So if this is inspiring to you at any time, you can check this out. I hope that you're doing well and enjoy today's episode. I am really honored and excited to have Congressman Tim Ryan joining us today. Tim, welcome and thank you so much for sharing your time and I know you're going to share a lot of really important content. Please",
