    "turn_idx": 51,
    "turn_text": "Well, it started with that retreat. And at the end of the retreat, because at that point, I had been in Congress six years, I think. And it was just after the 2008 election. I immediately went up to John at the end. It just had touched me in a very deep way. No journaling, no TV, no radio, no music, just kind of you and your mind and you drop into a deeper sense of being. And so I went up to John after that and seeing the world through a political mind or a governmental mind, I said, man, this got to be, we got to get this in the schools. We got to get this into our healthcare system. We got to get this into the prisons. We have all these veterans coming back. Yeah. Such deep trauma. How do we get this to them? You're seeing it now in the middle of the coronavirus, you know,",
