    "turn_idx": 178,
    "turn_text": "Exactly. But it's great. And for guys like me who do a lot of traveling, like to be home every day and wake up in my bed and not have to pack a suitcase or get in a car on a plane. It's just it's been really great, you know, and to see like five-year-old every day and just watching him grow up and it's just and then you know the kids are in teenage years and and watching them grow too and but really being able to pay attention to that without being on that treadmill. It's like okay, I don't want to get back on that treadmill.",
