    "turn_text": "Yeah, it's beautiful. And you recognize, even with your breath, just noticing it breathes through, you don't have to do anything different. Just be aware of it. So what is your greatest hope for how, I mean, I know you mentioned on so much of it, but, you know, as we grow as a nation, as we grow through healing, and this Opportunity. And I, you know, not to discount, like you said, the immense amount of suffering that is happening in our country and in the world right now as a result of this pandemic. But even in those suffering, there's a choice in how we respond to the suffering, right? So how do you best feel that as, you know, we come through this? Just your best personal wish for our nation.",
